show: WebAppStrategy.SIGN_UP
}));







 Forgot password 



1. Configure your Cloud Directory [settings](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-cloud-directorycd-settings) in the GUI. Allow users to manage their account from your app must be set to On.
